#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:1
msgid "Three-Mode Solvation Comparison"
msgstr "三模式溶剂化比较"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:3
msgid ""
"The three-mode comparison estimates how much the solvent environment changes the electronic "
"correlation contribution. It is more expensive than the fixed H2 smoke test. Run it after "
"`h2_mc_solvation.py`."
msgstr "三模式比较估计溶剂环境对电子相关贡献的影响。它的成本高于 fixed H2 冒烟测试。请在 `h2_mc_solvation.py` 之后运行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:7
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:13
msgid "Modes"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "公式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "`fixed`"
msgstr "`fixed`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "`E_QPE(H_vac) + E_MM`"
msgstr "`E_QPE(H_vac) + E_MM`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "Fast baseline that ignores solvent changes in correlation"
msgstr "忽略溶剂引起的电子相关变化的快速基线"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "`hf_corrected`"
msgstr "`hf_corrected`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "`E_HF(R) + E_MM`"
msgstr "`E_HF(R) + E_MM`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "HF-level MM embedding with interval QPE diagnostics"
msgstr "HF 层级的 MM 嵌入，并按间隔执行 QPE 诊断"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "`dynamic`"
msgstr "`dynamic`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "`E_QPE(H_eff) + E_MM`"
msgstr "`E_QPE(H_eff) + E_MM`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md
msgid "Runtime MM-embedded QPE coefficients"
msgstr "运行时 MM 嵌入 QPE 系数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:21
msgid "The comparison delegates analysis to `q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison()`."
msgstr "比较通过 `q2m3.solvation.analysis.run_mode_comparison()` 执行分析。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:23
msgid "Compile-Once Idea"
msgstr "编译一次的思路"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:44
msgid ""
"Dynamic mode uses Hamiltonian coefficients that Catalyst can trace at runtime. Catalyst compiles "
"the circuit structure once. The coefficients change across MC steps."
msgstr "Dynamic 模式使用 Catalyst 可在运行时追踪的哈密顿量系数。Catalyst 编译一次电路结构，系数在 MC 步骤间变化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:47
msgid "Reading The Result"
msgstr "解读结果"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:49
msgid ""
"The key scientific quantity is `delta_corr-pol`, the correlation-polarization coupling term. For "
"small H2 runs, it measures whether QPE energy changes materially when MM embedding changes the "
"Hamiltonian as well as the classical correction."
msgstr "关键科学量是电子相关与极化耦合项 `delta_corr-pol`。对于小规模 H2 运行，它衡量当 MM 嵌入不仅改变经典校正，还改变哈密顿量时，QPE 能量是否有实质变化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:53
msgid "Optional H3O+ Diagnostics"
msgstr "可选 H3O+ 诊断"

#: ../../source/tutorials/three-mode-solvation.md:55
msgid ""
"H3O+ workflows use a larger active space and many more Hamiltonian terms. The public H3O+ scripts"
" are useful for ionic-solvation diagnostics, but they are not the default tutorial path. Use a 16"
" GB+ RAM machine for `h3o_mc_solvation.py` and a 30 GB+ RAM machine for 8-bit or dynamic Trotter "
"diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"H3O+ 工作流使用更大的活性空间及更多哈密顿量项。公开 H3O+ 脚本可用于离子溶剂化诊断，但不是默认教程路径。运行 `h3o_mc_solvation.py` 时使用至少 16 GB "
"内存的机器；8 位或动态 Trotter 诊断使用至少 30 GB 内存的机器。"
